If you're writing your own Synergy client or server, you'll need to use the Synergy protocol.

These files describe the protocol:

* [https://github.com/symless/synergy-core/blob/master/src/lib/synergy/protocol_types.h protocol_types.h]
* [https://github.com/symless/synergy-core/blob/master/src/lib/synergy/protocol_types.cpp protocol_types.cpp]

The uSynergy code was a good example of how to use this protocol:

* [https://github.com/symless/synergy-core/blob/v1.8.8-stable/src/micro/uSynergy.h uSynergy.h]
* [https://github.com/symless/synergy-core/blob/v1.8.8-stable/src/micro/uSynergy.c uSynergy.c]

For more help, please use the [http://groups.google.com/group/synergy-dev developer mailing list].
